        {
          "say": "Test regression, A. Suppose the model also returns A, with winning probability point seven. The host authenticates the caller and checks that A is a legal ID. The policy for these four choices sends an investigation ticket when confidence is at least point six five. With four choices the uniform baseline is one quarter. Does this ticket qualify, or does it go to human review?",
          "start": 16.56,
          "end": 41.935,
          "duration": 25.375,
          "until": 44.435
        },
        {
          "say": "Subtract a quarter from point seven, then divide by three quarters. Its concentration score is point six. Send this ticket to human review. The log supports A, but the score falls short of the application's cutoff.",
